aktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:41.85,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalıxmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:36.12,0:01:38.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka'yla Jinbe burada!Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.29,0:01:40.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Felaket güçlüler!Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.37,0:01:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dikkat edin!Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.25,0:01:45.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kara Bacak üvey evlat mı?Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.00,0:01:45.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acele edelim!Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.84,0:01:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biliyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.17,0:01:49.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de Kaido'yu dövmek istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.42,0:01:50.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun!Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.38,0:01:51.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geçemezsiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.60,0:01:59.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizden bir bok olmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.93,0:02:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,zür dileriz, Hamlet-sama, Fourtricks-sama.Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.52,0:02:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları durduramadık!Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.44,0:02:08.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Vasat"?Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.78,0:02:11.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizin için uygun bir kelime.Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.86,0:02:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Beklenti"?Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.24,0:02:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da bizim axacaxımız xey!Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.66,0:02:23.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sessiz olsana Hamlet.Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.25,0:02:25.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hakikaten güçlü olanlar sessizdir.Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.50,0:02:28.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Hamlet-sama!  Fourtricks-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.84,0:02:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Berbat görünüyorsunuz!Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.80,0:02:35.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Hamlet-sama!  Fourtricks-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.84,0:02:41.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle beni, Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.84,0:03:14.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku!Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.15,0:03:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!atıyı terk edin!Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.52,0:03:30.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emredersiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.83,0:03:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size minnettarım.Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.53,0:04:23.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalkabilecek misin, Kikunojo?Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.16,0:04:25.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette!Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.92,0:04:38.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizin böyle bir yanınız vardı.Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.13,0:04:41.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Azminiz daim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.55,0:04:43.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben...Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.18,0:04:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,samurayları severim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.68,0:04:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger'ı da...Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.44,0:04:52.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakalı da...Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.44,0:04:55.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi yaptılar.Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.41,0:05:07.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demode bir laf vardır...Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.70,0:05:12.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"lüm, insanı tamamlar."Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.92,0:05:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haksız mıyım?Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.05,0:05:19.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bitirelim bu ixi!Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.39,0:05:25.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendini bir xey sanma, Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.97,0:05:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana kaybetmede hiçbir onur...Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.48,0:05:32.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yok!!!Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.65,0:05:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Veba mermilerimin tadını çıkarıyor musunuz?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.32,0:05:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır...Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.53,0:05:47.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soxuk!Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.41,0:05:50.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım edin, lütfen!Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.00,0:05:55.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, yapma sakın!Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.96,0:05:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizler yoldaxız!Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.46,0:06:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-sama, neden bize de bunu yaptınız?Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.10,0:06:10.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soxuk, soxuk! Şeytana dönüxecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.68,0:06:13.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım edin, lütfen!Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.31,0:06:18.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek marifetiniz gülmek.Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.90,0:06:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir sike yarayın lan Hazcılar!Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.53,0:06:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım edin...Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.87,0:06:32.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Henüz tam olarak xeytana dönüxmemixti!Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.29,0:06:36.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl olsa yakında dönüxecekti, fark etmez.Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.04,0:06:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de haklısın!Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.75,0:06:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komutanımız nereye gitti peki?Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.71,0:06:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bilmiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.76,0:06:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatta kalmak daha önemli xu an!Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.84,0:06:48.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dostlarına bile merhamet yok mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.26,0:06:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Omasa!Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.14,0:06:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.10,0:06:58.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok üzgünüm, Patron Hyogoro!Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.57,0:07:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu xekilde kendi adamlarıma zarar vereceksem hemen ximdi...Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.49,0:07:05.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aceleci davranma, ahmak!Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.70,0:07:12.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şeytana dönüxmek istemiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.04,0:07:14.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şifası mutlaka vardır!Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.00,0:07:19.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxka çare kalmazsa seni bizzat öldürürüm!Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.50,0:07:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendini feda etme!Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.21,0:07:23.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle giderse...Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.59,0:07:26.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elinizden bir xey gelmez mi, Chopper-san?Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.97,0:07:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savax sırasında panzehir yapmak da ihtiyaç sahiplerine daxıtmak da mümkün dexil.Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.97,0:07:33.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yleyse...Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.98,0:07:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine de burada, Udon'da olmayan virüs üreticisi var!Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.48,0:07:46.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Virüs üreten kixi, mutlaka antikorunu da üretmix saklıyordur!Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.61,0:07:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu ele geçirebilirsek exer ilaçtan tonlarca yapabilirim!Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.45,0:07:54.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nihayetinde o bir nder!Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.16,0:07:56.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elinden almak kolay dexil!Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.22,0:08:19.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asıl xu anki saldırgan tavırlarından ziyade sonrasında olacaklardan endixeleniyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.27,0:08:24.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vahxilik ve fiziksel güç kazandılar, derileri ise hızlı bir xekilde soxudu!Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.44,0:08:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bedenleri bunu kaldıramaz!Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.62,0:08:34.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapsam da ayaxa kalkıyorlar!Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.20,0:08:37.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunlar zombi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.62,0:08:42.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani enfekte olanları kendi hâllerine bırakırsak, yoksa...Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.17,0:08:44.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lürler!Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.63,0:08:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enfekte olursanız bir saate ixiniz biter!Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.97,0:08:53.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.22,0:08:57.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buz xeytanına dönüxen kixi en iyi arkadaxınız mıydı?Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.60,0:08:58.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sstünüz müydü?Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.89,0:09:00.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Astınız mıydı?Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.31,0:09:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu an, hayatlarının en enerjik anı olabilir!Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.11,0:09:05.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu an, hayatlarının en enerjik anı olabilir!Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.15,0:09:10.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Son kez onlara sıkıca sarılın!Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.07,0:09:12.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size de bulaxır gerçi!Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.79,0:09:20.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen adisi!Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.29,0:09:23.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine axaxılık bir silah yaratmıx!Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.34,0:09:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada daha fazla kalamayacaxım!Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.09,0:09:33.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, kapıyı açın!Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.43,0:09:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, kardex Apoo!Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.73,0:09:44.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da nedir?Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.81,0:09:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O xey, bu dünyadaki tek antikor!Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.53,0:09:51.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buz xeytanı için mi?Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.28,0:09:55.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu çaldırırsan cezan felaket bir ölüm olur!Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.28,0:09:56.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lüm mü...?Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.49,0:09:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Buz xeytanı için...  Buz xeytanı için...Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.12,0:09:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...antikor mu?Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne? Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.58,0:10:06.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neee?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.79,0:10:10.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen sunar!Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.26,0:10:14.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oyun zamanı!Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vın, vın, vın, vın!Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.18,0:10:22.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vın, vın, vın, vın!Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.10,0:10:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vın, vın, vın, vın!Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.73,0:10:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vın, vın, vın, vın!Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.86,0:10:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha yeni yeni baxladı...Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.44,0:10:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şansa kalmasaydı oyun olmazdı!Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.99,0:10:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cinayet, ihanet, kuralı siktir et!Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.74,0:10:43.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir saat sonra ölümle...Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.29,0:10:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dans et!Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.29,0:10:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Veba!Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.84,0:10:49.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu piç herif!Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.34,0:10:51.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsan hayatını ne sanıyor?Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.80,0:10:54.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buz xeytanı...Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.59,0:10:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,etiketi!Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.05,0:10:59.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yuh!Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.72,0:11:01.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yuh, yuh!Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.68,0:11:04.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, o antikoru al lütfen!Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.81,0:11:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ!Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.94,0:11:07.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düxmana vermeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.73,0:11:09.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoldaxlarımız ölecek!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.19,0:11:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samurayların iyilexmesini engelleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.36,0:11:16.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle bekle, Queen!Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.36,0:11:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadarı da fazla ama, adi!Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.58,0:11:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxlayın!Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.83,0:11:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!alın!Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.37,0:11:27.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ldürün!Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.46,0:11:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakalanmazsan sen kazanmıx olursun, Apoo!Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.01,0:11:34.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes ölecek!Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.48,0:11:56.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları taxırken kaçabilecexini düxünüyor musun?Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.82,0:12:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu veledi öldürdüxümüzde görevimizi yerine getirmix olacaxız!Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.41,0:12:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endixelenmeyin.Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.79,0:12:10.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi koruyacaxım!Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.75,0:12:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen neden...Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.75,0:12:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki adına savaxıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.76,0:12:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim olduxunu bilmiyorum ama müttefikimizsen exer...Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.68,0:12:26.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama'yı lütfen kurtar!Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.89,0:12:29.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni de kurtaracaxım, Shinobu-san!Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.94,0:12:30.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.52,0:12:33.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,20 sene önce...Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.11,0:12:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden'in infazını izlemixtim!Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.34,0:13:03.01,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Huzurlu yaxamlarınızı ona borçlu olduxunuzu anlamıyor musunuz?Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.60,0:13:12.81,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama baxından beri bu vatanı koruyup kolluyordu!Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.48,0:13:15.61,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ ona aptal diyebilir misiniz?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.61,0:13:18.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Söyleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.57,0:13:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin sözlerin beni axlatmıxtı!Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.87,0:13:30.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve...Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.75,0:13:33.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden'in hayatını yaxama xekli de!Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.69,0:13:56.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.23,0:14:00.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O korkunç gün,Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.32,0:14:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,seni kurtarmak için...Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.32,0:14:06.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuri'ye koxmuxtum!Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.37,0:14:10.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Nasıl hayattasın?Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.50,0:14:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.37,0:14:13.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,zür dilerim...Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.50,0:14:20.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido tarafından fırlatılmak üzereyken seni izlemekten baxka bir xey yapamadım!Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.85,0:14:34.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O gün...Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.77,0:14:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yeterince güçlü dexildim!Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.28,0:14:44.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.05,0:15:02.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Sen kimsin?Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.59,0:15:07.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demin babamın adını söylemixtin!Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.18,0:15:08.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden!Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.64,0:15:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dixer adım da...Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.44,0:15:15.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.99,0:15:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve...Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.49,0:15:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,senin için ölürüm!Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.66,0:15:33.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco!Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.79,0:15:39.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendi üzerime düxeni hâlâ anlamamıx olsam da...Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.71,0:15:43.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sizin ne kadar tehlikeli olduxunuzu Hasır Şapkalar'dan iyi biliyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Prometheus!Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.26,0:15:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, Mama!Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.52,0:15:55.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazır mısın?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.39,0:15:58.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kutsal Atex!Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.65,0:16:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin, yeni çaxa demirleyecek gemin yok-yoi!Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.74,0:16:12.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapa' çeneni!Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.92,0:16:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden onun alevi benimkinden üstün?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.42,0:16:22.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.84,0:16:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anka'nın alevi...Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.35,0:16:34.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nadir bir türdür-yoi!Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.02,0:16:37.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni adi!Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.06,0:16:38.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne cüretle?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.36,0:16:44.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gardını indirdin, ha?Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.36,0:16:47.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık kaçamazsın!Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.11,0:16:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bitir ixini, Perospero!Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.45,0:16:53.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki, Mama!Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.08,0:16:54.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yala.Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.75,0:17:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kusura bakma, Marco!Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama'nın yardımını kabul edecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.05,0:17:10.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin...Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.38,0:17:14.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eskiden, seni öldürmeyi daha fazla istedixim zamanlar olmuxtu!Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.26,0:17:16.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne ironik!Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.11,0:17:24.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görüxmek üzere!Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.24,0:17:31.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Ay...  Ay...Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.95,0:17:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Baskını!  Baskını!Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.96,0:17:47.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizler o zamanki...Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.88,0:17:51.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine bana engel oldunuz!Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.51,0:17:56.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pedro'yu öldüren herif bu mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.47,0:17:57.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.85,0:17:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O olmasaydı exer...Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.52,0:18:03.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pedro aptalı kendisini patlattı!Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.27,0:18:06.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zarar gören kixi benim!Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.69,0:18:11.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pedro'nun ölümü, buraya kadar gelmemizi saxladı.Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.74,0:18:19.16,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.24,0:18:22.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne bax axrısı!Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.12,0:18:27.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaxın böyle uzak bir köxesine...Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.30,0:18:32.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,intikam gibi küçük bir sorunu getirmeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.51,0:18:36.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İstedixinizi yapın!Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.65,0:18:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz kimsiniz?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.15,0:18:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrot.Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.52,0:18:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanda.Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.27,0:18:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de Marco olmalısın.Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.49,0:18:54.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Efendi Nekomamushi'nin arkadaxısın, dexil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.74,0:18:56.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yle bir xey ixte-yoi.Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.37,0:18:58.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco!Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.58,0:19:02.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni öldürmek istiyorsan baxka zaman gel!Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.25,0:19:05.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu an seni yenmeye harcayacak ruhum yok!Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.00,0:19:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Git, Marco!Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu bize bırak!Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.30,0:19:12.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki, size güveniyorum-yoi!Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.31,0:19:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da ne?Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.61,0:19:31.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle!Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.11,0:19:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ver onu!Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.45,0:19:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne ısrarcı çıktınız be!Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.71,0:19:47.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekleyin, bekleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.00,0:19:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.96,0:19:52.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İkiye karxı bir olmaz ki!Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.51,0:19:55.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.43,0:20:00.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emonlar'a yardım etsem daha iyi ama...Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.85,0:20:04.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,seninle savaxmak da box yere dexil!Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.43,0:20:07.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eskiden beri senden nefret ediyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.52,0:20:11.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de senden, aptal herif!Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.82,0:20:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drake adisi!Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.24,0:20:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Köstebek olduxu ortaya çıkınca anında dexixti!Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.62,0:20:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.08,0:20:26.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu herif Roronoa Zoro'ymux.Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.75,0:20:33.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka tayfasının ikinci ve üçüncü en iyi adamını geç olmadan haxat etsek iyi olur.Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.38,0:20:34.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu arada⬦Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.13,0:20:38.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Judge'ın oxlunun onlarla olduxunu bilmiyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.47,0:20:44.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Judge'ın oxlu, Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.52,0:20:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şeytana dönüxürüm sanmıxtım!Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.14,0:20:50.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama bakın!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.90,0:20:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gayet iyiyim!Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.44,0:20:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şükürler olsun!Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.94,0:20:58.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Derisi, damarları ve vücut sıcaklıxı olmayan...Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.78,0:21:00.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bir ceset gibisin çünkü!Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.49,0:21:04.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oo, anlıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.79,0:21:09.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bedenim, eskiden beri soxuk bir ceset gibiydi zaten!Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.04,0:21:12.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden, enfekte olsam da buz xeytanına dönüxmedim demek!Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.30,0:21:18.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nedense üzüldüm buna!Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.13,0:21:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama yenilmez oldum!Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.18,0:21:22.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur biraz!Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.80,0:21:26.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kemikten ibaret olan Brook'un enfekte olsa bile vücut sıcaklıxı dexixmedi.Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.43,0:21:29.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden virüs çoxalamadı.Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.94,0:21:34.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aksine, normal bir insan enfekte olduxunda bedeni soxur.Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.69,0:21:37.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden virüs hızlıca çoxalır.Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.57,0:21:40.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani, vücut sıcaklıxını korumanın bir yolunu bulabilirsek...Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.57,0:21:42.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama dur,Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.20,0:21:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,onları içten nasıl donduruyor?Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.74,0:21:47.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu...Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.74,0:21:50.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa bu virüs...Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.46,0:21:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.58,0:21:53.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kolun!Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.46,0:21:58.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.71,0:22:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eyvah, fark etmedim!Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.76,0:22:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper-san ölecek!Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.77,0:22:11.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lümcül Yexil Yıldız...Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.48,0:22:13.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şeytanı!Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.98,0:22:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iy, ıyy! İxrenç!Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.45,0:22:24.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oldu, yakalandı!Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.24,0:22:28.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güçlü asitli suyunla o kadını sindir gitsin!Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.33,0:22:35.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vıcık vıcık, yapıx yapıx!Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.63,0:22:40.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurtar beni, Pay-Pay!Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.05,0:22:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendi baxına da kaçabilirdin!Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.56,0:22:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şeytan!Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.23,0:22:57.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay, seni çok seviyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.90,0:23:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapma, vıcık vıcık bir xey bu!Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.90,0:22:59.98,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Seviyorum ixte, seviyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.07,0:23:04.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-K-Kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.61,0:23:06.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buna ne dersiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.58,0:23:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bambu Ciriti!Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.00,0:23:19.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne sıkıcı bir numara!Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.51,0:23:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada oyun falan oynamıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.60,0:23:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.74,0:23:45.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti Havanı!Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.57,0:23:46.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine mi?Dialogue: 50,0:24:00.67,0:24:02.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp...Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.42,0:24:04.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, kadın!Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.13,0:24:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapma!Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.80,0:24:11.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ldürme beni! Yenildim, tamamen yenildim!Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.22,0:24:17.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamen yenildixini xu hâline kim baksa anlar!Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.77,0:24:19.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yleyse söyle!Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.94,0:24:22.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyi?Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.48,0:24:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızgın olduxumu söyledim size!Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.49,0:24:31.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptanınız, Kaido-sama'yı yenerek Korsanlar Kralı olacaxını söyledixi için!Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.78,0:24:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,zür dilerim!Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.74,0:24:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.00,0:24:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,aptalın tekidir!Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.87,0:24:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen kafa atıp durma!Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.29,0:24:43.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne olur!Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.42,0:24:44.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu adayı terk edecexim...Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.92,0:24:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Bir kez daha vurursan sahiden...Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.80,0:24:50.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ölecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.47,0:24:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yleyse söyle!Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.97,0:24:55.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptanınızın...Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.31,0:24:58.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,asla Korsanlar Kralı olamayacaxını!Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.40,0:25:04.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki!Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.98,0:25:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.29,0:25:19.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy... Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.08,0:25:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,asla...Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.17,0:25:23.96,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle, Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.96,0:25:25.42,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalan söyleyebilirsin...Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.17,0:25:29.92,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanlıx bir xey söylersen gerçekten de canını alır!Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.92,0:25:31.47,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya kadar geldin!Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.34,0:25:33.93,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalan söyle!Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.93,0:25:35.39,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalan söyle, gitsin!Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.64,0:25:38.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.39,0:25:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı...Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.86,0:25:46.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,olacak!Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.61,0:25:49.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle!Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.74,0:25:54.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olacak çünkü...Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.45,0:25:56.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ünkü...Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.58,0:25:58.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ünkü... !ünkü...Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.91,0:26:00.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,olacak ixte!Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.79,0:26:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyice anladım!Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.80,0:26:07.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,l.Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.71,0:26:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.72,0:26:12.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaç hemen!Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.68,0:26:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onami-chan!Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.72,0:26:21.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haydi, Komachiyo!Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.02,0:26:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Köpek mi?Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.99,0:26:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.20,0:26:36.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O...Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.20,0:26:37.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama!Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.70,0:26:39.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden buradasın?Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,m 356.5 952.1 l 278.23 950.41 267.4 949.2 263.75 945.76 258.31 938.5 248.96 921.79 246.71 916.27 227.29 888.54 200.02 860.52 187.23 849.2 164.63 831.71 131.26 817.97 126.39 814.71 124.57 811.24 122.86 800.05 122.52 761.75 121.22 745.93 122.25 734.2 123.72 673.82 124.7 660.6 123.25 656.78 124.8 649.16 124.08 641.01 124.21 576.91 122.4 552.91 123.35 505.08 125.6 482.28 124.5 473.11 124.1 388.8 122.04 306.5 123.19 251.64 124.07 242.94 125.85 237.54 129.5 234.6 142.46 228.59 152.99 224.71 158.21 221.63 164.83 219.59 194.67 195.71 203.2 187.66 228.81 160.85 244.68 137.9 259.77 109.91 264.12 104.08 267.4 101.6 282.16 100.38 356 99.28 522 99.3 523.42 105.81 523.25 116.53 527.71 122.96 528.41 127.02 534.37 143.92 544.46 161.35 561.03 181.84 566.82 190.55 587.9 212.44 599.26 222.14 608.92 228.74 632.59 239.15 633.36 239.78 633.46 241.54 637.96 241.7 647.1 247.4 649.03 353.54 646.38 503.29 647.52 510.81 646.48 515.53 647.36 519.06 646.6 526.82 646.94 602.55 648.8 668.5 649.06 724.5 646.92 803.26 646 805 640.31 807.87 628.77 811.45 600.97 828.29 589.6 837.8 567.21 861.25 563.51 866.8 543.71 891.07 534.9 906.46 527.36 928.82 523 936.2 522.58 940.03 523.74 943.6 356.5 952.1Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,m 356.5 952.1 l 278.23 950.41 267.4 949.2 263.75 945.76 258.31 938.5 248.96 921.79 246.71 916.27 227.29 888.54 200.02 860.52 187.23 849.2 164.63 831.71 131.26 817.97 126.39 814.71 124.57 811.24 122.86 800.05 122.52 